186354599 1113 #uuid "eeba4fa8-124a-54c9-ba6c-4f189488c740" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354599 1145 "The arc length $L$ of a polar curve $r=r(\\theta )$ is given by\n\n$$\nL={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\nSince $r=3{e}^{\\theta },$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta }=3{e}^{\\theta }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the arc length is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{{(3{e}^{\\theta })}^{2}+{(3{e}^{\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{9{e}^{2\\theta }+9{e}^{2\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{18{e}^{2\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{e}^{\\theta }\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}\\,{e}^{\\theta }{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /4}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /4}-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354601 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354602 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354603 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354604 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354605 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1041 "selection" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354603 13194139535545 true] [17592186354600 1110 #uuid "e5b447a4-4384-55a0-831a-bdb7fbf86d1d" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354601 1034 "3\\sqrt{2}({e}^{\\pi /4}-{e}^{-\\pi /4})" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354601 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535545 true] [17592186354601 1111 #uuid "a4db64b8-39e3-5c3b-bc74-edf065084c81" 13194139535545 true] [17592186354602 1034 "\\sqrt{2}\\,{e}^